<title>UK: Merrill Lynch sets warrants on UBS.</title>
<headline>Merrill Lynch sets warrants on UBS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch Capital Markets AG, Zurich said it had issued five million American-style call warrants, on Union Bank of Switzerland bearer shares.</p>
<p>One share is controlled by 50 warrants.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    1450 CHF		  PREMIUM	11.6PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     2.25 CHF (INDIC)	GEARING	12.5 X</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 19.MAY.97-20.MAR.98   PAYDATE	14.MAY.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS EXCHANGE (APPL) SPOT REF     1400 CHF</p>
<p> MIN EXER	  100</p>
<p> PRICES QUOTED ON REUTER PAGE     MLCHF3</p>
<p>-- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
